{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B6H5S81mnhVo996s5vHMH5","type":"tool_result","content":"90\t * to reenter the initial phase.\n91\t *\n92\t * Probing rate and number of cruising cycles are function of the level:\n93\t *  - Level 0: push rate 3,125%, 4 cycles before push\n94\t *  - Level 1: push rate 6.25%, 4 cycles before push\n95\t *  - Level 2: push rate 25%, 4 cycles before push\n96\t *  - Level 3: push rate 25%, 1 cycle before push\n97\t */\n98\t\n99\t#define C4_WITH_LOGGING\n100\t\n101\t#define PICOQUIC_CC_ALGO_NUMBER_C4 8\n102\t#define C4_DELAY_THRESHOLD_MAX 25000\n103\t#define MULT1024(c, v) (((v)*(c)) >> 10)\n104\t#define C4_ALPHA_NEUTRAL_1024 1024 /* 100% */\n105\t#define C4_ALPHA_RECOVER_1024 960 /* 93.75% */\n106\t#define C4_ALPHA_RECOVER2_1024 896 /* 87.50% */\n107\t#define C4_ALPHA_CRUISE_1024 1024 /* 100% */\n108\t#define C4_ALPHA_PUSH_1024 1280 /* 125 % */\n109\t#define C4_ALPHA_PUSH_LOW_1024 1088 /* 106.25 % */\n110\t#define C4_ALPHA_PUSH_VERY_LOW_1024 1056 /* 103.125 % */\n111\t#define C4_ALPHA_INITIAL 2048 /* 200% */\n112\t#define C4_ALPHA_PREVIOUS_LOW 960 /* 93.75% */\n113\t#define C4_BETA_LOSS_1024 256 /* 25%, 1/4th */\n114\t#define C4_NB_PACKETS_BEFORE_LOSS 20\n115\t#define C4_NB_CRUISE_BEFORE_PUSH 4\n116\t#define C4_RTT_MARGIN_DELAY 15000\n117\t#define C4_MAX_RTT_MIN 1000\n118\t#define C4_MAX_JITTER 250000\n119\t#define C4_ECN_SHIFT_G 4 /* g = 1/2^4, gain parameter for alpha EWMA */\n120\t\n121\t#define C4_PROBE_LEVEL_MAX 3\n122\t#define C4_PROBE_LEVEL_DEFAULT 1\n123\t\n124\tuint64_t c4_push_rate_by_probe_level[C4_PROBE_LEVEL_MAX + 1] = {"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f4cd1bb-ca1b-49c0-a612-160336c885bd","uuid":"a46686f2-a8aa-4068-be92-9380b2e52f29","timestamp":"2026-05-07T13:56:14.630Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/richbarn/Projects/picoquic/picoquic/c4.c","content":" * to reenter the initial phase.\n *\n * Probing rate and number of cruising cycles are fun