{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PXzsaQuYvvttGL5V4pfzTw","type":"tool_result","content":"78\t// Rate / time / byte conversion (function-like macros in C).\n79\t\n80\t/// Bytes that fit on a link of `bps` bytes per second over\n81\t/// `microseconds`.  C: `BYTES_FROM_RATE`.\n82\tpub const fn bytes_from_rate(microseconds: u64, bps: u64) -> u64 {\n83\t    microseconds.wrapping_mul(bps) / 1_000_000\n84\t}\n85\t\n86\t/// Effective rate (bytes per second) implied by sending `bytes`\n87\t/// in `microseconds`.  C: `RATE_FROM_BYTES`.\n88\tpub const fn rate_from_bytes(bytes: u64, microseconds: u64) -> u64 {\n89\t    bytes.wrapping_mul(1_000_000) / microseconds\n90\t}\n91\t\n92\t// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n93\t// Filesystem path constants — Linux/macOS layout (the only target\n94\t// supported in v1; `_WINDOWS` paths are dropped per\n95\t// `TRANSLATE_PLAN.md`).\n96\t\n97\t/// Default solution-relative path used by the test fixtures."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f4cd1bb-ca1b-49c0-a612-160336c885bd","uuid":"610dda44-f42d-450f-afe6-6cdcd0381030","timestamp":"2026-05-07T13:58:03.595Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/richbarn/Projects/picoquic/rs/fq/src/utils.rs","content":"// Rate / time / byte conversion (function-like macros in C).\n\n/// Bytes that fit on a link of `bps` bytes per second over\n/// `microseconds`.  C: `BYTES_FROM_RATE`.\npub const fn bytes_from_rate(microseconds: u64, bps: u64) -> u64 {\n    microseconds.wrapping_mul(bps) / 1_000_000\n}\n\n/// Effective rate (bytes per second) implied by sending `bytes`\n/// in `microseconds`.  C: `RATE_FROM_BYTES`.\npub const fn rate_from_bytes(bytes: u64, microseconds: u64) -> u64 {\n    bytes.wrapping_mul(1_000_000) / microseconds\n}\n\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// Filesystem path constants — Linux/macOS layout (the only target\n// sup